   "lines": [
    "In the morning",
    "rowed around",
    "Centre Island. There",
    "was a stiff Norther",
    "blowing, and so heavy",
    "a sea running in",
    "the sound that the",
    "curlers filled the",
    "boat half full.",
    "Sailed home from",
    "Pine Island at a",
    "tremendous speed.",
    "In the afternoon",
    "took a brisk",
    "walk through the",
    "woods with my",
    "gun, but saw",
    "nothing."
   ],
